#question(title: [Sets and quantifiers], centered: true)[
  What are the following sets?

  + $display(A = {x in RR thin : thin forall y in [0 comma 1] comma thin x < y})$
  + $display(B = {x in RR thin : thin exists y in [0 comma 1] " s.t. " x < y})$
  + $display(C = {x in [0 comma 1] thin : thin forall y in [0 comma 1] comma x < y})$
  + $display(D = {x in [0 comma 1] thin : thin exists y in [0 comma 1] " s.t. " x < y})$
  + $display(E = {x in [0 comma 1] thin : thin exists y in RR " s.t. " x < y})$
  + $display(F = {x in [0 comma 1] thin : thin y in RR comma thin x < y})$
]
